# Conflict fixture: team-level rule overridden by a later individual rule.
#
# Pattern precedence (GitHub semantics): LAST matching rule wins.
#
# For `docs/api/reference.md`:
#   1. `docs/**`      matches → owners: @docs-team            (overridden)
#   2. `docs/api/**`  matches → owners: @alice @bob           ← WINS
#
# For `docs/USAGE.md`:
#   1. `docs/**`      matches → owners: @docs-team            ← WINS
#   (rule 2 does not match)
#
# For `src/index.ts`:
#   No rule matches → uncovered (no owners)

docs/**           @docs-team
docs/api/**       @alice @bob
